# Zooming into a note with no children and pressing Enter twice on its title, then o on the title, adds its first children inside the zoom rather than beside it.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
END
keys j j .
see 󰋜 › Work › Report › Draft due Friday
keys <Enter> <Enter>
type sub
keys <Esc> gg o
type o-sub
keys <Esc>
see ▌   o-sub
see     sub
keys ,
see ▌   Draft due Friday
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
			o-sub
			sub
	- Slides
END
